        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where <strong>speed, adrenaline, and friendship collide!</strong><br>Take control of a bold, big-eared bunny ready to face the city’s wildest racers in a thrilling mix of chaos and competition. The streets are alive with roaring engines, flashing lights, and high-speed action — and you’re right in the middle of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race across 20 unique city tracks</strong>, drifting through sharp turns, jumping over obstacles, and performing daring stunts. Master the art of timing your <strong>Nitrogen boost</strong> to leave opponents in the dust and create spectacular photo-finish moments. Each race tests your reflexes, courage, and creativity in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is simple:</strong><br>Reach the finish line first — by any means necessary. Use every trick available: outsmart rivals in corners, push them off the road, or take risky shortcuts to secure your victory. Together with your fearless bunny driver, you’ll form the ultimate racing duo driven by determination and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customize your car to improve speed, stability, and Nitro capacity. Each new level brings faster competitors, tougher turns, and more opportunities to prove your skill behind the wheel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>20 unique levels</strong> filled with surprises, shortcuts, and urban challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Nitro-powered racing system</strong> — unleash speed bursts at the perfect moment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐇 <strong>Dynamic stunt mechanics</strong> — jump, flip, and drift to earn rewards and style points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚘 <strong>Customizable vehicles and upgrades</strong> to boost performance and stand out on the track</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How About a Race?</strong> delivers a fast, fun, and energetic racing experience where skill and style decide who takes the trophy.<br>Do you have what it takes to cross the finish line first?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where <strong>speed, adrenaline, and friendship collide!</strong><br>Take control of a bold, big-eared bunny ready to face the city’s wildest racers in a thrilling mix of chaos and competition. The streets are alive with roaring engines, flashing lights, and high-speed action — and you’re right in the middle of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race across 20 unique city tracks</strong>, drifting through sharp turns, jumping over obstacles, and performing daring stunts. Master the art of timing your <strong>Nitrogen boost</strong> to leave opponents in the dust and create spectacular photo-finish moments. Each race tests your reflexes, courage, and creativity in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is simple:</strong><br>Reach the finish line first — by any means necessary. Use every trick available: outsmart rivals in corners, push them off the road, or take risky shortcuts to secure your victory. Together with your fearless bunny driver, you’ll form the ultimate racing duo driven by determination and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customize your car to improve speed, stability, and Nitro capacity. Each new level brings faster competitors, tougher turns, and more opportunities to prove your skill behind the wheel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>20 unique levels</strong> filled with surprises, shortcuts, and urban challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Nitro-powered racing system</strong> — unleash speed bursts at the perfect moment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐇 <strong>Dynamic stunt mechanics</strong> — jump, flip, and drift to earn rewards and style points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚘 <strong>Customizable vehicles and upgrades</strong> to boost performance and stand out on the track</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How About a Race?</strong> delivers a fast, fun, and energetic racing experience where skill and style decide who takes the trophy.<br>Do you have what it takes to cross the finish line first?</p>",
